{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "21fe0242defa7de2f0a123f940559549adecec8c142fe8c176feb93b72c64d58", "ja": "クリスマス公演の出番直前、\n緊張しながらも、みんなのサンタさんに\nなろうと頑張るアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "圣诞公演即将登场前，偶像们一边紧张着，一边努力想成为大家的圣诞老人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1000_se", "source_sha256": "30a844652a8e4c417c9bb6581faa7daae8c06488016155d4d1fbac2f9edaaf19", "ja": "ワアアァァーーーーーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "407d4f04a601fe5296c0a7063e21e7d62a2b325ccd0a3a1714f3e5bae3f66bc6", "ja": "（クリスマス公演は、大きな盛り上がりをみせている！\nさて、次は……）", "zh": "（圣诞公演正掀起一阵巨大的热潮！那么，接下来是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "062b6f337db9064496d3ea93cfca9f0c740762ef80939de0c93e40e0c9d8d7bb", "ja": "ううっ。やっぱり緊張しちゃうなぁ……。\nサンタさん、どうか私に勇気をくださいっ。", "zh": "呜呜。果然还是会紧张啊……\n圣诞老人，请赐予我勇气吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "1e103689cb0d21d6d7e4933df52b30e82d8173676e7a4b1853e734f6814526cd", "ja": "百合子さん……大丈夫、だよ。\n杏奈たち、たくさん練習したし……。", "zh": "百合子……没事的。  \n杏奈她们已经练习过很多次了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "2f377103e1187d9141541822bf323ed23d39d8aaf9481cf1675d8eeda772fe32", "ja": "劇場のみんなも、先輩たちも、ステージの攻略法……\n教えてくれたから……。", "zh": "剧场里的大家，还有前辈们，都教给我攻略舞台的方法……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "cc550b4e0855426b9a3f1bf7c31d15ff4072ca261251e4a656e6f4deac9f0b56", "ja": "うん……。うん、そうだったよね。\nありがとう杏奈ちゃん。いま勇気をもらえちゃった♪", "zh": "嗯……嗯，你说得对。\n谢谢你，杏奈。我现在鼓起勇气了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "eb2d32ee1abfffc0f0ed5357f86a8068399f8d073ada44ea8cac10d6946c2fff", "ja": "あ、もしかしたら、私のサンタさんは\n杏奈ちゃんだったのかな♪　……なんちゃって！", "zh": "啊，说不定我的圣诞老人就是杏奈吧♪……开玩笑的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "1ad7b630908e7e277f984771634ecd28302f7efb2fe01ed0e6463046a5973f0a", "ja": "あ、あれ？　今の、子どもっぽかった？\nあきれちゃった？？", "zh": "啊，咦？刚才那样是不是有点孩子气？\n你觉得我很无聊吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "97b86b2d5b438a66c5c8edc4709f6e4012199eb793364293a6ecf9618326b1b3", "ja": "ううん……。\nうれしい、だけ……。", "zh": "没有……。\n只是……觉得很高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "909b26eab6af5d15c3f4bbcd047aa0bf9b9e39474704cb610a9079691fe0a36b", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "738f167ceb20e05dd640adc8a580d277e3849eb6433f711a942d77436c73fd38", "ja": "おっ、いたいた。百合子、杏奈、次はふたりの出番だ。\n準備はいいな？", "zh": "哦，找到了。百合子、杏奈，接下来该你们上场了。\n准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "10a5485bbd15b5235b2134918c12b1efedfc2350ffacd2f367f9c6b65d7e761c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "609da2c9f5889227cc78ba4f7c482acf2bde573a871a0ba08954c16ad3bec5ca", "ja": "はい、大丈夫ですっ。実はついさっき、\n大丈夫じゃなくなりそうになったんですけど……。", "zh": "嗯，没问题！其实就在刚才，我差点就要变得不行了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "73d0d449a654d61680daa2c23bad45e21f49dff1e549ecdcea41fccb6d157f0b", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんのおかげで、すっかり大丈夫になりました。\nいつでも行けます！", "zh": "多亏了杏奈，我已经完全没事了。随时都可以出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "603392e1b5096f005f026f9ac759f7438c181b9f3503781f3d407077cd47b007", "ja": "おお、頼もしいな。ここ最近、ふたりで遅くまで\n残っているとは思っていたけど……。", "zh": "哦，真可靠啊。我最近也注意到你们俩总是练习到很晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "619629d51ec38f771466ff641f70465388d39664d201754aed6eedb5578a8d10", "ja": "しっかり自信がつくくらい、\n実のある練習を積めていたってことか。えらいぞ！", "zh": "也就是说，你们最近一直在进行充实的练习，已经足以建立起扎实的自信了啊。做得好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "b26a4c5740e0a06b816cf413fdafae21871dd0fe43436ba6843ca42faa42680c", "ja": "いいえ、当然のことです。これはファンのみなさんに、\n素敵なクリスマスを過ごしてもらうための公演なので！", "zh": "没有的事，这都是理所当然的。因为这场演出，\n是为了让粉丝们度过一个美好的圣诞节啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "d2a07e50b6cde786934ad837cf369439a2e3ede25c0b593b548f83a1331444f7", "ja": "心から楽しんでもらえるように、杏奈ちゃんと……\nみんなと一緒に、たくさん頑張っただけです。ねっ♪", "zh": "只要能让大家发自内心地感到开心，\n我和杏奈……还有大家一起付出的那些努力就都值得了。对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "89f34baaeafa9c1d75824f63e0c3d2961c05d14c0953113400d5c3fd10875bde", "ja": "うん……♪", "zh": "嗯……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8222deb6bfa7eff3c3f3d8743b8525f9f2ada9606a15611a7286e31ce6c14224", "ja": "いい準備ができたんだな。\nよし、そろそろ行こう。", "zh": "准备得很不错嘛。\n好，差不多该出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b3ff039f9c19b1cbd6110bfcd6de468d5b16899cd920e1ed8e101865a8e927c4", "ja": "今日はクリスマスだ。ふたりからもファンのみんなに、\nとびきりのプレゼントを届けてあげてくれ！", "zh": "今天是圣诞节。你们也要为所有粉丝送上最棒的礼物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
