{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "0c20bf18e48682d12adabd0971d616ad917a0ca930393c00a2b7098413306456", "ja": "え？　……あ、そっか。\nそうです、今日はクリスマスですよ！", "zh": "诶？……啊，原来如此。\n没错，今天是圣诞节哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "93db4e29115908b9be92829226527a61e33f63a127117331c99ddf38ac013abc", "ja": "ん？　もちろん知ってるけど……\nそれがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？我当然知道啊……\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "a6bd1332b2d5daa6aa85c58654f7fcd13e29a10503467ab790a0795728f3e113", "ja": "クリスマスは、みんなに幸せが訪れる日。私たち、\nとびきりのプレゼントをお届けしますから……。", "zh": "圣诞节是幸福降临到大家身上的日子。我们会为大家送上特别棒的礼物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_024_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_024_fc_01_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "f2764e1136667f3d9f37e2ff6f343ce48b94cfe3008101890b2b504ff9e64c84", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\nちゃんと受け取ってくださいねっ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生也\n一定要好好收下哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
